'''5.''' To or toward times or things past; backward in time: as, to look ''back'' on former ages.
{{smaller block|<poem>Oh, that constant Time
Would but go ''back'' a week!</poem>
{{right|''Fletcher (and another)'', Love’s Cure, v. 3.}}
Volumes of this form dated ''back'' two hundred years or more.
{{right|''Hawthorne'', Old Manse.}}
